@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Start Small. Learn Fast.
+
+## Reframe
+Entrepreneurship is not presented as a cliff jump. It is a sequence of small, useful experiments. A gold spark becomes a practical pathway, showing how one offer can move toward one real group of people.
+
+## Visual story
+The lesson moves from the oversized myth of “the leap” to a compact experiment card, then builds a human-centered AI toolkit, a track map, and a final three-part question. Navy provides confidence; blue organizes information; gold marks the active choice.
+
+## Motion idea
+A single paused, seekable timeline reveals each beat with short upward moves, scale settles, and rule draws. The final beat resolves the three prompts into one gold experiment node.
