@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Design — Start Small. Learn Fast.
+
+## Direction
+Editorial motion graphics with generous space, decisive typography, and diagram-led storytelling. The composition uses SCLA navy as the stage, white and cultured panels for clarity, blue for structure, and gold only for the key experiment or active state.
+
+## Type and layout
+Proxima Nova with system fallback. Headlines are 72–104px and heavy; supporting copy is 40–46px. All content stays inside a 120px frame with the lower 120px reserved. Each scene has one dominant message and no more than five supporting objects.
+
+## Scene language
+1. Shrink the startup myth into a small experiment.
+2. Present five accessible starting points around an experiment card.
+3. Separate AI assistance from human essentials.
+4. State the track promise with a clean speed/clarity/testing triad.
+5. Draw the module pathway toward a 30–90 day launch.
+6. Replace forever-business pressure with one smart experiment.
+7. Resolve useful thing + real people + realistic way into “test faster with AI.”
+
+## Motion
+Entrances last 0.45–0.6 seconds and settle within 1.2 seconds. Scene changes use a 0.3-second content fade while persistent top chrome remains. No infinite motion. The closing node receives one additive pulse in the final second.
